  "roads": "Open, no chains",
  "text": "Happy Thanksgiving from Mt Baldy! It's our official opening day.\n\nChair 2 is running 9 AM – 5 PM, with Beginner's Gulch, Snowball Point and the freestyle terrain open. Chair 1 is running for scenic rides only. The Snow Play area is open too. The rest of the mountain is closed for now. Pray for snow!\n\nThanksgiving Day: Sunny and mild, with a high near 53° up top and a light northeast breeze.\n\nTickets are still available. See you on the mountain.",
